  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你在找什么书？\n\n丽丽：本，好巧啊！你也来买书？\n本：丽丽，好久不见！是啊，我来买中文书。\n小雨：丽丽，他是谁？\n丽丽：小雨，他叫本，是我的好朋友。本，她叫……\n小雨：你好！我叫林雨书，是丽丽的朋友。\n本：你好！\n丽丽：本，你在找什么书呢？\n本：HSK3级的书。我今年要考HSK3级。\n小雨：我知道在哪，我带你去吧！丽丽，你不是还有事吗，我带本去找书就好。\n丽丽：好吧！\n本：小雨，谢谢你！",
    "traditional": "你在找什麼書？\n\n麗麗：本，好巧啊！你也來買書？\n本：麗麗，好久不見！是啊，我來買中文書。\n小雨：麗麗，他是誰？\n麗麗：小雨，他叫本，是我的好朋友。本，她叫……\n小雨：你好！我叫林雨書，是麗麗的朋友。\n本：你好！\n麗麗：本，你在找什麼書呢？\n本：HSK3級的書。我今年要考HSK3級。\n小雨：我知道在哪，我帶你去吧！麗麗，你不是還有事嗎，我帶本去找書就好。\n麗麗：好吧！\n本：小雨，謝謝你！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What Book Are You Looking For?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：本，好巧啊！你也来买书？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：本，好巧啊！你也來買書？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì běn hǎo qiǎo a nǐ yě lái mǎi shū",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Ben, what a coincidence! Are you also here to buy a book?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：丽丽，好久不见！是啊，我来买中文书。",
      "traditional": "本：麗麗，好久不見！是啊，我來買中文書。",
      "pinyin": "běn lì lì hǎo jiǔ bu jiàn shì a wǒ lái mǎi zhōng wén shū",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Lili, long time no see! Yes, I'm here to buy a Chinese book."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小雨：丽丽，他是谁？",
      "traditional": "小雨：麗麗，他是誰？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ lì lì tā shì shéi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Lili, who's he?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：小雨，他叫本，是我的好朋友。本，她叫……",
      "traditional": "麗麗：小雨，他叫本，是我的好朋友。本，她叫……",
      "pinyin": "lì lì xiǎo yǔ tā jiào běn shì wǒ de hǎo péng you běn tā jiào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Little Yu, his name is Ben. He's a good friend of mine. Ben, this is…"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小雨：你好！我叫林雨书，是丽丽的朋友。",
      "traditional": "小雨：你好！我叫林雨書，是麗麗的朋友。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ nǐ hǎo wǒ jiào lín yǔ shū shì lì lì de péng you",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Hello! I'm Lin Yushu. I'm Lili's friend."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：你好！",
      "traditional": "本：你好！",
      "pinyin": "běn nǐ hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Hello!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "丽丽：本，你在找什么书呢？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：本，你在找什麼書呢？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì běn nǐ zài zhǎo shén me shū ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Ben, what book are you looking for?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "本：HSK3级的书。我今年要考HSK3级。",
      "traditional": "本：HSK3級的書。我今年要考HSK3級。",
      "pinyin": "běn 3 1 jí de shū wǒ jīn nián yào kǎo 3 1 jí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: An HSK3 book. I'm taking HSK3 this year."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "小雨：我知道在哪，我带你去吧！",
      "traditional": "小雨：我知道在哪，我帶你去吧！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ wǒ zhī dào zài nǎ wǒ dài nǐ qù ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "丽丽，你不是还有事吗，我带本去找书就好。",
      "traditional": "麗麗，你不是還有事嗎，我帶本去找書就好。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nǐ bú shì hái yǒu shì ma wǒ dài běn qù zhǎo shū jiù hǎo",
      "english": "Little Yu: I know where they are. I'll take you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili, didn't you have something to do? I'll help Ben look for his book."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "丽丽：好吧！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：好吧！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hǎo ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Alright!"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "本：小雨，谢谢你！",
      "traditional": "本：小雨，謝謝你！",
      "pinyin": "běn xiǎo yǔ xiè xie nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Little Yu, thank you!"
    }
  ],
